svistr2            DFALT_SCAN_BLANKS CERAI CERAI_MATI BELUM_MENIKAH


MAP(mapra4)
g_grpnam        svistr5           REPLACE
gv_CLSD         svists            REPLACE_IF ctlk00  
gv_TACC         svists            REPLACE_IF ctlk11


EDITS(tmptranst)
